# Build context hygiene. Every first-party image builds from the repo root
# (docker build -f <component>/Dockerfile .); keep everything that is
# host-local, generated, or secret out of the image layers.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.git
.gitignore
.claude
**/coverage
**/.env
**/*.log
platforms/compose/.env
README.md
# docs/ feeds the Hermes images (environment maps + conventions); only the
# binary assets stay out.
docs/*.png
